{
  "steps": [
    "1) Triage & context gathering: confirm alert metadata, timeline, and immediate account balances for root ACC-D0003-RT00 to establish scope and urgency.",
    "2) Flow mapping (scatter-gather pattern): trace outgoing and incoming payment legs from the root account over the alert window to build directed fund-flow graphs and identify candidate destination clusters.",
    "3) Candidate enrichment: for top destination accounts/clusters, pull KYC, commercial registry, and counterparty histories to distinguish benign business activity from suspicious patterns (e.g., shell companies, rapid dispersals).",
    "4) Flow validation & conservation: compute flow conservation across graph segments, quantify amounts that re-aggregate vs. disperse, and flag anomalous splits/round-trips inconsistent with declared business purpose.",
    "5) Regulatory correlation: check applicable AML/CTR and local Indian (INR) regulations, thresholds, and reporting clauses that apply to scatter-gather typologies and the alert amount INR 3,706,351.03.",
    "6) Replanning & deep tracing: based on preliminary graph comparisons, replan deeper hops for high-risk nodes (increase depth or include alternate counterparties) and recompute metrics to prioritize exposures requiring escalation.",
    "7) Synthesis & reporting: compile findings, include flow diagrams, thresholds breached, KYC red flags, and recommended disposition (monitor / file SAR / freeze / escalate to law enforcement)."
  ],
  "handoffs": [
    {
      "task_id": "HO-FLOW",
      "target_agent": "flow_tracer",
      "objective": "Perform alert-context retrieval for ALT-V2-D0003 and reconstruct fund-flow graphs starting from root ACC-D0003-RT00 for the alert time window. Identify candidate destination accounts/clusters involved in scatter-gather dispersals, compute flow conservation at each node, and produce a prioritized list of suspicious downstream targets with suggested follow-up hops. Provide raw graph runs for comparison and any recommended replan parameters.",
      "allowed_tool_budget": 4
    },
    {
      "task_id": "HO-BENIGN",
      "target_agent": "benign_investigator",
      "objective": "For the top 10 candidate destination accounts/clusters identified by flow_tracer, retrieve KYC profiles, check commercial registry entries, and assemble counterparty transaction histories to assess business legitimacy. Flag indicators such as recent incorporation, nominee directors, frequent small inbound splits, lack of operating history, or links to known high-risk entities. Return enrichment summary per account with recommended risk score adjustments.",
      "allowed_tool_budget": 5
    },
    {
      "task_id": "HO-REG",
      "target_agent": "regulatory_analyst",
      "objective": "Search and return relevant regulatory rules and clauses applicable to scatter-gather typologies for INR-denominated transactions, including AML thresholds, mandatory reporting clauses, and any India-specific reporting/reporting timelines that apply to amounts at or above INR 3,706,351.03. Provide clause identifiers and short guidance on reportability and escalation criteria.",
      "allowed_tool_budget": 2
    },
    {
      "task_id": "HO-CRITIC",
      "target_agent": "reporter_critic",
      "objective": "Independently compute flow conservation summaries for the provided graph outputs and validate arithmetic consistency. Critically review the planned disposition text and recommended escalation steps; produce a concise critique of evidentiary gaps and suggest final report structure and essential artifacts to include (e.g., timelines, flow tables, KYC snapshots).",
